UID:98233-1796470200-1796477400@bangaloreinternationalcentre.org
SUMMARY:Mast Mahila Mandali | Cool Ladies Club
DESCRIPTION:72 min | Marathi & Hindi\, with English subtitles | 2026 \nA riotous\, genre-bending documentary\, this film is about how women labour\, love\, and claim joy in everyday life. Ten women from the eastern suburbs of Mumbai sign up for a filmmaking workshop\, plunging into a messy\, immersive\, eighteen-month process of making a film together. \nStealing time away from family responsibilities and daily chores\, they turn the camera on themselves. They capture the life of the city’s working class\, while talking about husbands\, murders\, toilets\, and everything in between. When joy is a radical act\, it can only thrive in community. \nCredits:\nDirectors: Shilpi Gulati\, Anjum Shaikh\, Darshana Mayekar\, Gauri Rane\, Kavita Ghuge\, Kavita Khomne\, Nazneen Siddiqui\, Rehana Sheikh\, Rohini Kadam\, Sheetal Navle\, Vaishali Mane\nProducer: CORO India \nIn collaboration with: \n      \nVenue: Seminar Halls\n\n\n\nTen Women. Five Smartphones. One Film.\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf8oG8hQDwZbmvQu8xmoylZJtvzAgrADEF3oz-hDbe8IK2yug/viewform?usp=publish-editor)\n*Speakers*: Shilpi Gulati\, Anjum Shaikh\, Sheetal Navle\n*Event Categories*: Cities\, Film\, Gender\, Society
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/mast-mahila-mandali/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Cities,Film,Gender,Society
